window.products.push({"id":1088162,"name":"BaggySacky Cordless Blackout Cellular Shade RV Honeycomb Blind 69”W x 48”L Fabric Shades Mocha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":97.68,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A1F8XGOhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What buyers say 1. Highly recommend for all of your window treatment needs, be mindful there is a front and back to them as they only clip in one way.2. Considering that the shade itself won't last longer than years with dust, rips and sun damage, I'd much rather replace these every few years than hang on to the dirty and more expensive blinds.3. They work so smoothly and do not drop down at all, where you set them is where they stay, until you apply light pressure underneath and push them back up.4. Easy to pull down & pull up to open or close the blinds when needed, cleaning/dusting is easy too.5. I bought a 28\"W x 48\"H to replace the mini blinds in my camper trailer, be mindful they have 1/2 inch deduction from width.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A1F8XGOhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BaggySacky","source_asin":"B09FPHKRXW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1088162","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FPHKRXW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FPHKRXW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1088163,"name":"Nobranded Modern Mute DIY Wall Clock 3D Mirror Wall Clocks Sticker Metal Big Clock for Home Office Decorations,Frameless Wall Clock, (Silver)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XgenSStYL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Let me explain to everyone about the sales problem during this period 1. Please pay attention to the products sold by Gesen Technology. Recently, criminals have imitated our products with poor quality, which has caused trouble to customers who trust us. 2. The product needs an AA battery and the surface protection film needs to be torn off, so that the product will be the color on the picture 3. Thank you everyone for your support. If you have any questions, you can initiate Q&A SIZE :Can be adjusted according to preferences (between 35.4inch-59.1inch)  | color :black, gold,silver,red,blue Our 3d mirror wall clock This wall clock uses safe and environmentally friendly acrylic materials with non-marking nails, super strong to withstand gravity without harming your wall, designed for home decoration Installation adapts to the wall surface: painted,wooden,wallpaper,smooth tile,composite panel,glass wall surface Product specification -Material: Acrylic，EVA Foam -Size: diameter 35.4inch-59.1inch(Can be adjusted according to preferences) -Product weight: 0.99 pounds package instruction -Watch movement -Hands and numbers (plastic film covers the surface) -hook up -Install the ruler -Installation Notes Cleaning method: This product is very easy to clean，directly wipe the dust on the surface with a damp cloth, the watch core and pointer can be  removed for care After-sales service Our products are of high quality and we guarantee that unconditional returns and exchanges will be provided Due to product quali","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XgenSStYL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nobranded","source_asin":"B08BR9CH8K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1088163","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BR9CH8K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BR9CH8K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1088164,"name":"Shpex Cocktail Shaker Set| Drink Mixer Kit W/24Oz Stainless Steel Shaker, Jigger, x3 Pourers| BONUS Recipes Booklet & Ebook For Delicious Martinis, Ma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GJuue8RzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COCKTAILS- THE SOUL OF A GOOD PARTY: It’s no secret that in order to have an awesome party, you need awesome cocktails! With our cocktail shaker set your guests are set up for endless fun and entertainment as you will be delivering the best cocktails! This professional-grade quality Drink Mixer Kit is bound to be your favorite kitchen and home bar tool! COMPLETE SET-IMPECCABLE QUALITY: Our cocktail making kit will simply give you the best value out your money! Nowhere else will you find a set that contains a 24 Oz, 100% LEAKRPOOF, Stainless Steel Shaker, a two size double Jigger (1 & 1.5 Oz) and THREE top grade liquor pourers! BECOME A MIX MASTER IN NO TIME: The bonus goodies don’t just stop there! Along with every bartending starter kit, you get the exclusive “Luxury Recipes” booklet and the “Special Cocktails Drinks & Tips” E-book. The E-book & Booklet are packed with delicious recipes for Martinis, Margaritas and all sorts of cocktail recipes so that you get the most out of your drink shaker kit! IDEAL FOR EVERYONE: Whether you’re a cocktail novice who’s looking to get into making his own cocktails at home, or even a pro bartender who’s on the lookout for a premium cocktail making kit, this professional quality shaker with recipes is a perfect choice. The impeccable design, the high quality stainless steel shaker, the top grade bonus jigger and pourers along with the free booklet & E-book, are bound to put a smile on everyone’s face! 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE: This drink mixer-shaker is simply the most ideal gift for everyone who enjoys a good cocktail. Plus, it comes packaged in a sleek box that is bound to make a stellar first impression! Combining such high quality with so many bonus goodies AND a 100% Money Back Guarantee, you just can’t go wrong! Click add to cart now and get on your way to become a mix guru in no time!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GJuue8RzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shpex","source_asin":"B01GAOKW8E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1088164","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GAOKW8E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GAOKW8E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1088165,"name":"Melange 12-Piece 100% Melamine Dinnerware Set (Gold Leaves Collection ) | Shatter-Proof and Chip-Resistant Melamine Plates and Bowls | Dinner Plate, S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IGwIPD3bL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Experience the Difference of an Authentic Melamine Dinner Set Upgrade your dinnerware set with one that blends superior durability, hassle-free maintenance, and rustic charm. Made using heavy weight melamine, these dinner plate and bowls are virtually unbreakable, keeps chips and cracks at bay, and can actually be cleaned in the dishwasher. Introduce some quirk to your dinner table with a beautiful melamine dinnerware set that doesn't cut corners. - Heavy duty feel and break-resistant design. - Comes in multiple pack options at a price you'll love. - Assorted colors - Dishwasher safe and 100% BPA-free. - Great for camping, RVs and outdoor use. Extra Dose of Durability Not all melamine dinner sets are created equal. Most come with a melamine content of between 30-60% that makes them weak, prone to cracks, and easy to shatter. But we've taken the premium approach and used higher percentage of melamine to create dinner plates and bowls that beautifully weather the rigors of everyday use Great for Outdoors No need for paper plates. Whether you're going out camping, having an outdoor soiree, or setting off in your RV or trailer, our melamine plates and bowls complement it all with a touch of durability. Tough and hardy, this dinnerware set introduces a sense of normalcy to outdoor dining without any of the fragility. Maintenance Made Easy Get yourself melamine plates and bowls that you can actually clean in the dishwasher. While others break or crack while placed in there, our fully melamine dinner set can be safely cleaned without chipping the plates or ruining the design. Dine in Style Quirky yet cute, vintage yet modern, this colorful melamine dinnerware infuses any setting with a charm that never quits. The plates and bowls come in multiple colors and design options and are crowned by beautiful asymmetry. About Mélange Mélange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We believe fine dinner sets shouldn't mean fragile dinner sets. We believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. That's why we've used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone's eye.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IGwIPD3bL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B074W4JZZL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1088165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074W4JZZL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074W4JZZL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
