window.products.push({"id":1088532,"name":"CooCoCo 12”Foldaway Fan with Remote Control,Rechargeable 7200mAh Battery Operated Fan, Cordless Portable Fan,Adjustable Height Oscillating Standing Fa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71105QQ6XVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"12” Portable Fan: With innovative foldable & flexible design,this cordless fan can be widely used.It can be a table fan,standing fan,travel fan,camping fan,pedestal fan,etc. The diameter is 11.8” and the adjustable height range is 5.5~42.5”to meet your different needs. Only 11.8*5.4 inches when folded, making it easy to store and carry in your luggage. Oscillating fan & Remote Control & 9 Timers,this foldaway floor fan automatically swings 90 degrees to keep you cool from different directions. With a remote control, it is convenient for you to operate and set the functions freely from a distance without bending over. The folding fan has 9 timers from 1h~9h to choose from, so you don't need to worry after falling asleep. Long-lasting Battery Powered Fan: Built in 7200mAh battery that can be charged via the provided Type-C USB cable. After fully charged,the rechargeable fan can last 3~37 hours depending on different speed settings. Also can be used while charging. 8 Speeds & Ultra Quiet: The portable camping fan has 8 cooling fan speeds for options. It’s adopted the lastest brushless noise reduction motor. Even at the strongest speed, the noise is less than 30db. It brings you an ultra-quiet and comfortable coolness environment while you work,study or sleep. Adjustable Head Angle & Detachable for Cleaning: The head tilt angle of this wireless foldable fan is 180 degree adjustable.Its front grille is removable for easy cleaning. The bottom of the base is designed with a non-slip silicone pad to make the fan more stable. Perfect for home,office,and outdoor use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71105QQ6XVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CooCoCo","source_asin":"B0C6F242BG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1088532","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6F242BG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6F242BG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1088533,"name":"OVENTE Electric Panini Press Grill with Nonstick Plates, LED Indicator Lights and Thermostat Control, Compact Sandwich Maker Perfect for Cooking Break","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cl04u5SbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Better food, better mood! Why make a simple, dull sandwich if you can transform it into a grilled, subway-style one? Let that deliciousness jump into your mouth and satisfy your craving with our Ovente Electric Panini Grill. Prepare delectable and savory restaurant-style meals at home! It has a 750W fast-heating element and top and bottom cooking plate for even heat. Once turned on, it just takes a few minutes to reach the desired cooking temperature. Ideal for grilling burgers, chicken, steak, and veggies and creating omelets, French toast, paninis, and sandwiches.Cleaning is a snap with its top and bottom nonstick-coated cooking plates! Turn off the sandwich grill and wipe the plates with a kitchen sponge or a towel soaked in warm, soapy water to remove any remaining oil and food. Anti-skid feet provide greater stability and grip on smooth surfaces. With its cool-touch handle, you can effortlessly check the toasting of your meal. Thermostat control avoids overheating, so you won't have to worry about your food burning.Grill whenever and wherever you want. Its modest size is ideal for a small kitchen, office, or dorm room. The contact grill takes up very little counter or shelf space due to its compact size, making storage simple and practical.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cl04u5SbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OVENTE","source_asin":"B0B4X4KF6Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1088533","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4X4KF6Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4X4KF6Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
