window.products.push({"id":1088572,"name":"Small Electric Stove Portable, 500W Mini Stove Hot Plate 4.2 Inches Heating Plate, Multifunction Countertop Burner for Ceramic Glass Kettle Single Pla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.07,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Suld4wt6L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Specification: Condition: 100% Brand New Material: Stainless Steel Power: 500W Plug and Voltage: US Plug 110V, EU Plug 220V (optional) Heating Plate Diameter: Approx. 107mm / 4.2in Size: Approx. 145*140*65 mm / 5.7*5.5*2.6 in Weight: Approx. 776g / 27.4 oz  Package list: 1 * Mini Stove 1 * Manual 4 * Rubber Cushion  Instructions: 1. Please turn on in the fifth gear and heat for 3-5 minutes when you use the stove at the first time. There may be a small amount of smoke exhausted, which is caused by the evaporation of the protective film of the stove surface. This is a normal phenomenon. It is basically disappeared after continuous heating in the fifth gear for 10 minutes or more for 2-3 times. 2. If the bottom of the stove is not flat, concave and convex, it cannot be used.  Operational Rules: Rotate the electric stove switch to operate and there are 5 ranges to adjust the temperature of the electric stove. Adjust the switch to the appropriate range to make the electric stove reach the required temperature. Please note that turn the switch to the \"0\"/\"off\" position and unplug the plug when not in use.  Safety Precautions: 1. Cannot leave when using. 2. Do not touch the stove while heating. 3. Do not immerse the electric stove in water or other liquids. 4. The electric stove is for cooking food, the utensils should be put on the heating plate when you cooking. 5. When the electric stove is not in use, be sure to turn the switch to the \"0\"/\"off\" position and unplug the plug.  Note: The red light below the housing will go out when the electric stove reaches the temperature you adjust. When it is lower than the temperature you adjust, the red light will be on. Cycle work and automatically keep warm.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Suld4wt6L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yosoo Health Gear","source_asin":"B0BGWZLS51","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1088572","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGWZLS51","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGWZLS51","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
