window.products.push({"id":1088584,"name":"Buona Mattina ARC700 Super Automatic Espresso Machine with Grinder, Touch Screen, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":425.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418E0++HBJL._AC_.jpg","description":"Revolutionize office coffee your automatic espresso machine, This Coffee maker with grinder is about to surpass your expectations. Introducing the Buona Mattina ARC700 single cup coffee brewing station, your answer to your mid-afternoon Coffee cravings at work. No longer will you have to spend valuable break time waiting in line to get your triple soy Latte with whip, you can now simply Walk down the hall to your break room and brew your favorite cafe drink with time to get caught up on your favorite book. Great tasting coffee bring the Coffee shop right to your break room. With a simple touch on the LCD display, you can brew: espresso, americano, cappuccino, Latte, or even get hot water for your favorite tea. In order to achieve Coffee shop tasting coffee, The Buona Mattina ARC700 Coffee maker pushes hotter water at a greater pressure through the freshly pressed Coffee grounds. This brewing process leads to a less bitter Coffee that has a crisper and more satisfying taste. And you'll soon say \"Buona Mattina\" In the office, which is Italian for \"good morning! \" Everyone will love it! what makes the Buona Mattina ARC700 great for the office, is the cost savings of not having to stock up on costly single-serve coffee pods. Just load up the ARC700 with the office's favorite Coffee bean and get ready to brew your favorite Coffee in no time. We all know that one co-worker who only drinks decaffeinated Coffee but don't worry, the rest of the office will no longer suffer. The Buona Mattina ARC700 has a Coffee grounds bypass that can be utilized for decaffeinated Coffee aficionados. Buona Mattina is proud to offer you a product free from defects in workmanship and materials, under normal use and conditions, for a period of (2) years From date of purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418E0++HBJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Buona Mattina","source_asin":"B0184E6VR4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1088584","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0184E6VR4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0184E6VR4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
