window.products.push({"id":1088615,"name":"Etterno King Size European Comforter - Authentic Down Comforter, King Size, Made in Denmark, Machine Washable Duvet Insert, All-Season 675 Fill Power,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jyj99VI7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FINEST EUROPEAN CRAFTSMANSHIP. LASTS FOR DECADES: Unlike others, Etterno down comforters are meticulously processed and carefully handcrafted by skilled Danish artisans with impeccable attention to detail. So you get the softest, fluffiest, leak-proof, skin-friendly, and breathable down comforters that you might even pass down to your future generations MADE IN DENMARK. SO YOU KNOW IT’S ETHICALLY SOURCED REAL DOWN: ONLY in our sophisticated Denmark production house, raw materials are tested with microscopic precision that determines the down and feathers. The NOMITE label certifies high-density firmly woven fabric. So you’re guaranteed to breathe clean air all night!. The Downafresh greenLine (EN12935) label guarantees absolute cleanliness and purity of the fill materials(no foul odor, no harmful substances) EXPENSIVE, BUT EXTRAORDINARY IN EVERY SENSE: Compared to the shoddy, bogus down comforters that conceal their origins, Etterno might seem expensive. But if you consider the rare, authentic, & verifiable European down, time-tested Danish making, everlasting comfort & coziness, and a lifetime of serene sleep you get every winter night, you'll know we offer the best value for money. Just pay once, and happily sleep forever (without complaints)! FUNCTIONALLY-SUPERIOR BAFFLE BOX CONSTRUCTION. SO NO LUMPS & COLD SPOTS: The multi-compartmental baffle box construction promises ultra-comfort and cloud-like loftiness. All the time. That’s because the thickness is evenly spread throughout the comforter. It traps more air, preventing heat loss. So you never have to worry about inner filling moving around, getting lumpy, or waking up to a cold spot SIMPLE MAINTENANCE. HAPPINESS GUARANTEED. OR MONEY BACK: Available in 985 g King Medium (106\" W x 90\" L), this down comforter is shipped in a unique sailor bag. Smart packing makes sure you don’t have to wait for long for the comforters to fluff up (a usual problem with vacuum packaging). Machine washable, so don’t be intimidated when it comes to cleaning. If you’re unhappy for any reason, we’ll offer your money-back as per Amazon's refund policy","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jyj99VI7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"California Design Den","source_asin":"B09H6SCVSX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1088615","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H6SCVSX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H6SCVSX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
