window.products.push({"id":1088717,"name":"Ice Cream Maker Machine 1.5 QT Automatic Homemade Electric Ice Cream Machine Soft Serve Easy Instruction No Rock Salt No Ice","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gC0N-9VvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY OPERATION: Transparent Lid, easy to remove & lock, watch process. Large Spout, pour ingredient directly. Assemble & clean Mixing Paddle & Freezer Bowl with warm soapy water VERSATILITY: No messing around with rock ice & salt. Come out soft serve consistency perfectly or harder ice cream by placing in freezer for a while. BPA free, good gift idea DURABILITY: Heavy-duty Motor & Double Insulated Freezer Bowl make fast even frozen treat in 20 mins. Mixing paddle mix, scrape & aerate frozen dessert without manual intensive stir VALUE FOR MONEY: Perfect size 1.5 qt for couples, great for occasional treat. More affordable than ice cream machine with a compressor or constantly buy ice cream in the store HEALTHY FLAVOR: Recipes included. Or Create your own unique taste, make natural or keto ice cream by controlling intake of candy, cookies, fruit, chocolate, caramel or condiments EASY TO USE: 1. FREEZE: Place Freezer Bowl into the coldest part of freezer at -0.4 ℉ for 8-12 hours. The bowl should be completely frozen without liquid sloshing sound under shaking 2. STIR & COOL: Whisk together ingredients in a container and put it in the fridge for 30-60 mins. The cooler ice-cream mix the faster churning process 3. POWER ON: MUST start ice cream machine first, then pour cool mix through Spout on Lid. Add fruits or nuts when ice cream is almost done. Don't mix them too early 4. FAST & EVEN FROZEN: Churn and create soft serve consistency for 20 mins. If you want it to firm up, dip it out of the drum and placing in the freezer for an hour","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gC0N-9VvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vpcok Direct","source_asin":"B09V7QTTXG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1088717","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V7QTTXG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V7QTTXG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
