window.products.push({"id":1088785,"name":"FIAHOSEY Faux Plants Indoor - 2Pcs Fake Hanging Potted Pothos Plant for Home Decor Artificial Greenery for Bedroom Living Room Office Garden Wall Shel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716qvR88WkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Faux plants can be a great addition to your indoor space for adding a touch of greenery without the need for maintenance. The 2pcs fake hanging potted Pothos plants like a lovely choice for home decor. Here are some details about artificial greenery and how you can use them in different areas: 1. Advantages of Faux Plants: - Low maintenance: Unlike real plants, faux plants don't require watering, sunlight, or regular care. - Durability: Artificial plants are long-lasting and can maintain their appearance for an extended period. - Allergy-friendly: Faux plants are an excellent alternative for individuals with plant allergies. - Versatility: You can place faux plants in various locations, including areas with low light or high humidity, where real plants might not thrive. 2. Pothos Plant: - Pothos (Epipremnum aureum) is a popular choice for indoor plants due to its trailing vines and heart-shaped leaves. - The artificial Pothos plants you have are designed to mimic the appearance of real Pothos plants, providing a realistic and aesthetic touch to your space. 3. Placement Options: - Bedroom: Hang the faux plants near a window, on a shelf, or mount them on the wall for a soothing and natural ambiance. - Living room: Place the hanging Pothos plants in decorative baskets or hang them from the ceiling to create a lively and green atmosphere. - Office: Enhance your workspace by adding the artificial Pothos plants to your desk, shelves, or hang them near windows or on the wall for a refreshing touch. - Garden or balcony: Faux plants are also suitable for outdoor areas where real plants might be challenging to maintain. Place the hanging Pothos plants on your garden wall or hang them from the ceiling of your balcony. Overall, the 2pcs fake hanging potted Pothos plants can bring a touch of nature and beauty to your home decor in the bedroom, living room, office, garden, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716qvR88WkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FIAHOSEY","source_asin":"B09YN7WD52","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1088785","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YN7WD52","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YN7WD52","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
